[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0619","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0619.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0540","title":"Allaire JRun JSP 演示文件信息泄露漏洞","description":"Allaire JRun 2.3.x 的 JSP 示例文件存在访问控制漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 viewsource.jsp 等示例页面访问服务器上的任意文件或获取配置信息，从而泄露敏感数据。该漏洞影响 Allaire JRun 2.3.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等，攻击者无需凭据即可在网络上远程发起攻击且利用复杂度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0540"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:57.397","remediation":"立即升级 Allaire JRun 至 3.0 或更高版本（已修复该漏洞），或彻底删除 JRun 安装目录下的示例 JSP 文件（如 viewsource.jsp、simple.jsp 等）；若无法升级，请在 Web 服务器层面配置访问控制规则，禁止外部访问 /samples/ 目录及所有 .jsp 示例文件，并重启 JRun 服务使配置生效。建议尽快迁移至受支持的现代应用服务器（如 Apache Tomcat、WildFly 等）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=16290&Method=Full","http://www.osvdb.org/2713","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1386","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4774","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1f2f850a48475dab7b1e1b1c322080edeefb8fa2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0540.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0540","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8ebd6486a02ca9f434893ea11941a54d5b5dfa32/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0540.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98bfa0c64da76a68ffd6d214f436c90f142d4964/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0540.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/jrun.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-28m9-8pxg-9chc/GHSA-28m9-8pxg-9chc.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0540.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/D/DDI_JRun_Sample_Files.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idinfor"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0619.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0617","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0617.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0539","title":"Allaire JRun 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Allaire JRun 2.3.x 版本的 Servlet 示例存在信息泄露漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可以通过 SessionServlet servlet 获取目标系统的敏感信息，例如列出有效的 HttpSession ID 列表。该漏洞影响运行 JRun 2.3.x 的所有服务器，攻击者无需任何凭证即可在不需要交互的情况下远程利用此漏洞，可能导致会话劫持或其他基于获取会话标识符的后续攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0539"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:57.270","remediation":"立即应用 Allaire 官方安全补丁（补丁 ID 16290），或将 JRun 升级至 3.1 及以上版本。若无法立即升级，应删除 JRun 安装目录下 /servlets/ 路径中的示例 Servlet（尤其是 SessionServlet），并在 Web 服务器（如 IIS 或 Apache）配置访问控制规则，禁止外部访问 /servlets/* 路径，同时检查并清理已泄露的 HttpSession ID。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=16290&Method=Full","http://www.osvdb.org/818","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1386","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4774","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b2590bad63419b553765bbd6d832ae2cc703aff/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0539.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0539","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/80b9e46bc035d31d1e13fdb38c5f781e8a013488/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0539.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3249236c34411e31ff9cfd40b20136dbc5077a03/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0539.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/25ad427cb260813264acc83dfac643f53a339579/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wwgv-vf3h-hmgf/GHSA-wwgv-vf3h-hmgf.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0539.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0539.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/DDI_JRun_Sample_Files.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0617.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0617.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0478","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0478.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0617","title":"Stanley T. Shebs Xconq 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Xconq 和 cconq 游戏程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过设置过长的 USER 环境变量触发该漏洞。本地用户利用此漏洞可获取额外的系统权限，进而提升本地访问权限。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 系统上的 Xconq 7.2.2 及 cconq 相关程序，CVSS 评分为 4.6，危害等级较低。利用条件为攻击者需具备本地用户身份，通过构造超长的 USER 环境变量值即可触发缓冲区溢出，实现本地权限提升。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0617"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:07.173","remediation":"升级 xconq/cconq 至厂商修复版本，限制 USER 环境变量长度（如设为不超过 256 字节），或临时卸载 xconq 和 cconq 游戏程序以消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0222.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20093","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d2be4eb036a20db5be632f5ca0ba66a631c4d156/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0617.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f