","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1376","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-06-15&msg=4.1.20000621113334.00996820%40qlink.queensu.ca","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0609.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0609","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0609.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0609.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-82f3-pqxp-8f9v/GHSA-82f3-pqxp-8f9v.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0609.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0609.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1376/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--696f3f7c-d9e3-4858-96e3-63e1d01dac02.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0730.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0726","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0726.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0608","title":"NetWin DMailWeb/cwMail POP 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NetWin dMailWeb 和 cwMail 2.6i 及更早版本的 POP 服务存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过发送过长的 POP 参数（pophost）触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务崩溃造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 NetWin dMailWeb 和 cwMail 2.6i 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），属于拒绝服务类漏洞，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，通过发送超长 POP 参数即可触发服务崩溃导致拒绝服务攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0608"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:06.090","remediation":"建议升级至 NetWin dMailWeb 或 cwMail 的最新版本以修复该 POP 拒绝服务漏洞，同时检查是否有厂商发布的安全补丁。若暂时无法升级，可在防火墙或访问控制列表（ACL）中限制仅允许受信任 IP 访问 POP 服务端口（默认 110），或在不使用 POP 服务时临时禁用该服务作为缓解措施。此外，建议在邮件网关部署流量监控，检测异常的过长 POP 请求参数以提前发现攻击行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1376","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-06-15&msg=4.1.20000621113334.00996820%40qlink.queensu.ca","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0608.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0608","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0608.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0608.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-665p-mhgh-xxcv/GHSA-665p-mhgh-xxcv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0608.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1376/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0608.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6b0d9f38-8e80-4862-953f-53d9859bd8f5.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0726.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0726.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0726.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0723","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0723.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0606","title":"Linux KON kon 程序缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 系统中 Kanji on Console (KON) 软件包的 kon 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户可通过向 -StartupMessage 参数传递超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，导致攻击者能够以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Mandrake Linux 等发行版本，需要本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0606"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:05.847","remediation":"升级 kon 程序包至已修复版本（如 Mandrake 官方更新中修复此问题的版本）。如无法升级，立即移除以 root 权限运行的 kon 二进制文件的 setuid 位（`chmod u-s /usr/bin/kon`），并限制仅授权用户可执行，防止本地普通用户触发缓冲区溢出提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1371","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.21.0006192340340.19998-100000%40ferret.lmh.ox.ac.uk","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0606.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0606","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0606.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0606.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/96d4f89872236c04a1a34287b2e6b358501d08ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rxxv-f2jp-v9vp/GHSA-rxxv-f2jp-v9vp.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266