5ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0604.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0604.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8b80e198eccaa13040dbe03d79f3c9c06085d067/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h3fp-c6fr-mp9h/GHSA-h3fp-c6fr-mp9h.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0604.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/c9b68d7e9fee580d97403fe7a317626fdb0fba2c/2000.tsv","https://github.com/RiskBasedPrioritization/RiskBasedPrioritizationAnalysis/blob/3d5cc1819ecb8cbc3aeb75d9a8260318544faf56/data_in/acme/acme_cves.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0719.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0715","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0715.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0602","title":"Red Hat Secure Locate 权限提升漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 系统中 Secure Locate（slocate）工具存在权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过设置 LOCATE_PATH 环境变量指向特制的恶意配置文件，当 slocate 执行时读取该配置文件，导致攻击者获取 root 或更高权限。该漏洞影响 slocate 组件所在的多版本 Red Hat Linux 系统，攻击者需拥有本地账户访问权限即可利用，危害中等。建议升级至 slocate 最新版本或限制 LOCATE_PATH 环境变量的使用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0602"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:05.363","remediation":"升级 slocate 至 2.6-1 或更高版本。如无法升级，可移除 slocate 的 SUID 权限：`chmod u-s /usr/bin/slocate`。同时避免以 root 身份运行 slocate，并限制用户对 `LOCATE_PATH` 环境变量的控制能力。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1385","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.21.0006211209500.22969-100000%40nimue.tpi.pl","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e0f32c85b8b697ba27f9f77ead2aeb825574252/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0602.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0602","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0602.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0602.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/76afc904d2c3de5054b6306275bb2a85f23de0a1/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hx6m-rxfx-9j6c/GHSA-hx6m-rxfx-9j6c.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0602.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0715.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0677","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0677.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0579","title":"SGI IRIX crontab 可预测临时文件导致本地文件修改漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 操作系统中的 crontab 命令在编辑计划任务时，会在 /tmp 目录下创建临时文件，但这些临时文件使用了可预测的文件名，并继承了当前用户的 umask 权限设置。本地攻击者可通过预测临时文件名，在目标用户编辑 crontab 文件期间进行符号链接攻击，从而修改其他用户的 crontab 文件内容，进而获取更高权限或执行未授权操作。该漏洞影响 IRIX 6.x 及更早版本，需要本地访问权限且满足竞争窗口条件。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0579"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:02.440","remediation":"升级到 SGI IRIX 6.5.8 及以上版本，或安装 SGI 安全补丁 4310。如无法升级，将 umask 设置为 077 并确保 /tmp 目录使用粘滞位（chmod 1777 /tmp），同时限制 crontab 仅 root 用户可执行。使用非予测文件名（如 mkstemp）的替代 crontab 工具也可作为临时缓解方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0204.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1413","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c729733510a7fb9b2cb302c6d8fbcecf1fc7ba0f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0579.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0579","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0579.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cd9d7030fbc42684ccfa32eb6cd959ffcadf351/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0579.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pxpj-c4wv-6w3x/GHSA-pxpj-c4wv-6w3x.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0579.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6f1f2c9a-1115-49bf-adbc-0d6c0d8585ff.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--6f1f2c9a-1115-49bf-adbc-0d6c0d8585ff.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0677.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0675","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0675.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0578","title":"SGI MIPSPro Compiler 临时文件可预测漏洞","description":"SGI MIPSPro 编译器（C、C++、F77 及 F90）在编译过程中会在 /tmp 目录下生成临时文件，由于文件名可被预测，本地攻击者可利用此缺陷在目标用户编译时向临时文件中注入恶意代码，从而实现权限提升或代码执行。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 系统上的 MIPSPro 编译器，CVSS 评分 3.7，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0578"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:02.313","remediation":"建议升级 SGI MIPSPro Compiler 至 7.30 及以上版本，该版本已修复临时文件可预测问题。如无法升级，可通过设置环境变量 TMPDIR 将临时文件重定向到权限受限的专用目录，并确保编译目录的 umask 设置为 077 以防止其他用户读取或篡改临时文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0204.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1412","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c729733510a7fb9b2cb302c6d8fbcecf1fc7ba0f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0578.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0578","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0578.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cd9d7030fbc42684ccfa32eb6cd959ffcadf351/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0578.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9hpg-q52c-898c/GHSA-9hpg-q52c-898c.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0578.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--27dd7fed-1450-49c4-ae3a-4960c87b11b8.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/123da3a025e41a87a2b5f10a435135d4edd28636/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0675.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0580","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0580.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0513","title":"Easy Software Products CUPS 不存在的用户名认证拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0513是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0513"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:53.787","remediation":"建议立即将 CUPS 升级至 1.0.5 或更高版本，或从 https://www.cups.org/ 下载并应用对应安全补丁。如需临时缓解，可在 /etc/cups/cupsd.conf 中通过 AuthType 配置限制远程认证访问，仅允许受信任主机访问 IPP 服务端口 631。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0188.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1373","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4846","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24762ffc4408618d0c62379d258b248e81056dc1/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0513.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0513","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0513.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8305d7f6f9031873a5609178b8b2d4422836eee7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0513.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-jvqm-q54c-fwxg/GHSA-jvqm-q54c-fwxg.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0513.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0513.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--af809574-968a-4de7-ad6c-8725366060b5.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0580.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0574","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0574.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0511","title":"Easy Software Products CUPS 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CUPS（通用Unix打印系统）1.04及更早版本存在拒绝服务漏洞，其Web管理界面中的CGI组件在处理远程攻击者发送的特制HTTP POST请求时无法正确解析输入数据，导致服务进程资源被耗尽或异常终止。该漏洞影响所有安装受影响版本CUPS的Unix/Linux系统，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可通过网络远程发起攻击，只要目标系统CUPS的HTTP接口可达即可触发。攻击者仅需向目标发送构造的CGI POST请求即可使CUPS打印服务停止响应，造成系统打印功能中断，CVSS v2评分5.0，危害等级为中危。Easy Software Products已在CUPS 1.0.5版本中发布补丁修复此漏洞，用户应尽快升级至安全版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0511"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:53.533","remediation":"tags.<value>立即将 CUPS 升级至 1.0.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 POST 请求拒绝服务漏洞。升级后重新启动 cupsd 服务以生效。若无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器层面禁用对 /cgi-bin/cups/ 路径的 POST 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0188.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1373","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4846","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dbab824db2d42b734971c1b87553018066aa35d2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0511.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0511","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0511.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6a16668a1632a04fd23488d1308b95bb656fd69/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0511.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/458762a518138a26e597ac195eb82ce6c30238eb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-2q76-rgp3-v4w5/GHSA-2q76-rgp3-v4w5.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0511.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0511.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--93ae6467-99d9-4f12-91a3-2af76980d1f1.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0574.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0574.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0574.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0573","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0573.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0510","title":"Easy Software Products CUPS 畸形 IPP 请求拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Easy Software Products 的 CUPS（Common Unix Printing System）在 1.1.4-3 及更早版本中，对 IPP（Internet Printing Protocol）请求处理不当。远程攻击者无需身份认证，即可向目标打印服务发送畸形 IPP 请求，触发拒绝服务，导致打印服务不可用。该漏洞影响网络可达的 CUPS 服务，攻击条件为可访问目标 IPP 端口，利用方式为构造并发送异常 IPP 报文，CVSS 约 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0510"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:53.397","remediation":"立即将 CUPS 升级至 1.0.5 或更高版本，或对 1.0.4 及更早版本下载并应用官方 cups-DoS.patch 后重新编译安装 cupsd；若暂无法升级，在防火墙将 631/tcp（IPP）仅放行内网可信主机并禁止公网访问，同时关闭不必要的远程打印共享。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0188.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1373","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4846","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d2be4eb036a20db5be632f5ca0ba66a631c4d156/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0510.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0510","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0510.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f59a7fbf5b47ecd49b181f13f4091ea609ec99d4/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0510.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/458762a518138a26e597ac195eb82ce6c30238eb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-86pm-xpc9-jgrw/GHSA-86pm-xpc9-jgrw.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0510.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0510.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--54e54f0b-b859-4f0c-8cdf-f032f5a25d6d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0573.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0476","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0476.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0607","title":"马德拉/RedHat Kon2 控制台 fld 程序缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Mandrake Linux 7.0/7.1 及 RedHat Kon2 0.3.9 版本中的 Kanji on Console (KON) 包含的 fld 程序（/usr/bin/fld）存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。该程序在处理输入文件中的 CHARSET_REGISTRY 和 CHARSET_ENCODING 字段时未进行边界检查，本地攻击者可构造包含超长字符集注册表或编码设置的恶意输入文件，诱使 fld 程序处理时触发栈溢出，覆盖返回地址并执行任意 Shellcode，从而将权限提升至 root。该漏洞为本地提权漏洞（CVSS 7.2，AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），攻击者需具备本地账户访问权限并能执行 fld 程序，通过诱导受害者处理恶意字体文件或直接调用 fld 处理恶意输入文件即可实现提权。ExploitDB 已公开 PoC（EDB-ID: 20024），利用代码公开可用。受影响版本包括 Mandrake Linux 7.0/7.1 及 RedHat 发行版中搭载的 Kon2 0.3.9 版本，厂商已发布补丁修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0607"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:05.970","remediation":"建议立即升级 Mandrake 至 7.2 或更高版本，或升级 RedHat Kon2 至 0.3.9 以上修复版本；若无法立即升级，可执行 `chmod u-s /usr/bin/fld` 移除 fld 程序的 setuid 权限，或卸载 kon2 软件包（`rpm -e kon2`）作为临时缓解措施，限制本地用户通过 fld 缓冲区溢出提权获取 root 权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1371","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.21.0006192340340.19998-100000%40ferret.lmh.ox.ac.uk","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20024","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0607.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0607","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/fbf5034ab66635f118016eef30012810a55b9a37/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0607.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0607.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p6c2-5pjm-qmjv/GHSA-p6c2-5pjm-qmjv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0607.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--795091f9-81db-4ba2-8510-55fb8cdbefb8.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0607.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0476.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0460","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0460.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0577","title":"网景 Professional Services FTP Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于 Netscape Professional Services FTP Server 1.3.6（LDAP Aware）中， assailants 利用目录遍历（Path Traversal）攻击向量，通过在 FTP 请求中使用 \"..\"(dot dot) 序列绕过目录限制，非法访问目标服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞严重威胁着系统安全，由于攻击无需任何身份验证即可触发，远程攻击者可以轻易遍历文件系统读取敏感文件，甚至可能进一步执行代码，导致系统完全失控。该漏洞影响 Netscape Professional Services FTP Server 1.3.6 版本， CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级极高。攻击者仅需向目标 FTP 服务器发送包含恶意路径的常规FTP命令即可利用此漏洞，攻击条件极其简单，全球范围内数以万计的网络设备都受到此漏洞的影响。Microsoft 和其他厂商已发布安全补丁修复此漏洞，建议及时更新至最新版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0577"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:02.193","remediation":"建议立即迁移至现代 FTP 服务器（如 vsftpd、ProFTPD）并启用 chroot 限制用户根目录。若必须继续使用 Netscape FTP 1.3.6，请在防火墙层面限制 FTP 端口(21/TCP)仅对可信 IP 开放，并在服务器文件系统层面为 FTP 用户设置严格 chroot 目录权限，禁止目录遍历权限。Netscape 官方已停止支持该产品，无官方补丁可用，建议尽快迁移替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0345.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1411","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.21.0006211351280.23780-100000%40nimue.tpi.pl","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20046","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0577.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b555